#. module: bf_property_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_privacy/models/bf_property_organisation.py:0
msgid ""
"Aucune politique de conservation n'est déclarée pour le journal des colis et"
" des visiteurs."
msgstr "No retention policy is declared for the parcel and visitor log."

#. module: bf_property_privacy
#: model_terms:privacy.purpose,plain_language_summary:bf_property_privacy.purpose_property_sms
msgid ""
"Avec votre consentement exprès, le syndicat inscrit votre\n"
"                numéro de téléphone mobile au registre pour vous joindre par\n"
"                message texte : l'arrivée d'un colis à votre nom, ou un avis\n"
"                urgent concernant l'immeuble."
msgstr ""
"With your express consent, the syndicate enters your\n"
"                mobile telephone number in the register in order to reach you by\n"
"                text message: the arrival of a parcel in your name, or an urgent\n"
"                notice concerning the immovable."

#. module: bf_property_privacy
#: model:privacy.purpose,name:bf_property_privacy.purpose_property_sms
msgid "Avis aux occupants par texto"
msgstr "Text-message notices to occupants"

#. module: bf_property_privacy
#: model:privacy.notice,name:bf_property_privacy.notice_property_sms
msgid "Avis par texto du syndicat"
msgstr "Text-message notices from the syndicate"

#. module: bf_property_privacy
#: model_terms:privacy.purpose,plain_language_summary:bf_property_privacy.purpose_property_sms
msgid ""
"Ce numéro ne sert qu'aux avis que vous avez acceptés. Vous\n"
"                pouvez retirer votre consentement en tout temps, canal par\n"
"                canal, et le retrait ferme l'envoi sans effacer la trace de ce\n"
"                qui était permis auparavant."
msgstr ""
"This number serves only the notices you have accepted. You\n"
"                may withdraw your consent at any time, channel by\n"
"                channel, and the withdrawal closes sending without erasing\n"
"                the trace of what was permitted before."

#. module: bf_property_privacy
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_privacy.field_bf_property_organisation__privacy_retention_declared
msgid ""
"Ce que la politique de conservation du journal des colis et des visiteurs "
"annonce, au registre des activités de traitement."
msgstr ""
"What the retention policy of the parcel and visitor log announces, in the "
"register of processing activities."

#. module: bf_property_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_privacy.view_property_sms_consent_form_privacy
msgid ""
"Cette ligne n'a pas de dossier au registre des\n"
"                            traitements. Les consentements recueillis avant\n"
"                            l'installation de ce pont n'en reçoivent pas\n"
"                            rétroactivement : leur en fabriquer un aujourd'hui\n"
"                            donnerait une preuve qui ment sur sa propre date."
msgstr ""
"This line has no file in the register of\n"
"                            processing activities. Consents collected before\n"
"                            this bridge was installed do not receive one\n"
"                            retroactively: making one today would give\n"
"                            proof that lies about its own date."

#. module: bf_property_privacy
#: model:ir.model,name:bf_property_privacy.model_bf_property_sms_consent
msgid "Consentement à être joint par texto"
msgstr "Consent to be contacted by text message"

#. module: bf_property_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_privacy.view_property_organisation_form_privacy
msgid "Conservation du journal (Loi 25)"
msgstr "Log retention (Act 25)"

#. module: bf_property_privacy
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_property_privacy.field_bf_property_sms_consent__privacy_consent_id
msgid "Dossier Loi 25"
msgstr "Act 25 file"

#. module: bf_property_privacy
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_property_privacy.field_bf_property_organisation__privacy_retention_declared
msgid "Durée déclarée au registre des traitements"
msgstr "Period declared in the register of processing activities"

#. module: bf_property_privacy
#: model:privacy.purpose,name:bf_property_privacy.purpose_property_access_log
msgid "Journal des colis et des visiteurs"
msgstr "Parcel and visitor log"

#. module: bf_property_privacy
#: model_terms:privacy.purpose,plain_language_summary:bf_property_privacy.purpose_property_access_log
msgid ""
"La réception de l'immeuble consigne les colis reçus au nom\n"
"                des occupants et les visiteurs annoncés : le nom du visiteur, la\n"
"                nature de la visite, l'heure attendue et, si le syndicat gère un\n"
"                stationnement, la plaque du véhicule."
msgstr ""
"The front desk records parcels received in occupants' names\n"
"                and announced visitors: the visitor's name, the nature of the\n"
"                visit, the expected time and, if the syndicate manages a\n"
"                parking area, the vehicle's plate."

#. module: bf_property_privacy
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_privacy.field_bf_property_sms_consent__privacy_consent_id
msgid ""
"Le consentement formel correspondant au registre des activités de "
"traitement. C'est un miroir : ce qui décide si un texto part reste la ligne "
"ci-dessus."
msgstr ""
"The formal consent matching the register of processing activities. It is a "
"mirror: what decides whether a text message goes out remains the line above."

#. module: bf_property_privacy
#: model_terms:privacy.purpose,plain_language_summary:bf_property_privacy.purpose_property_access_log
msgid ""
"Le journal se purge automatiquement après la durée fixée par\n"
"                le syndicat, une fois le colis remis ou la visite terminée. Un\n"
"                colis encore en dépôt et un visiteur encore attendu ne se\n"
"                purgent pas, quelle que soit leur date."
msgstr ""
"The log purges itself automatically after the period set by\n"
"                the syndicate, once the parcel is handed over or the visit is\n"
"                over. A parcel still held and a visitor still expected are not\n"
"                purged, whatever their date."

#. module: bf_property_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_privacy/models/bf_property_organisation.py:0
msgid ""
"Le registre des traitements annonce %(declared)d jours, ce syndicat en "
"applique %(applied)d."
msgstr ""
"The register of processing activities announces %(declared)d days; this "
"syndicate applies %(applied)d."

#. module: bf_property_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_privacy/models/bf_property_organisation.py:0
msgid ""
"Le registre des traitements annonce %(declared)d jours, et ce syndicat ne "
"purge pas son journal. Ce qui est déclaré n'est pas ce qui est fait."
msgstr ""
"The register of processing activities announces %(declared)d days, and this "
"syndicate does not purge its log. What is declared is not what is done."

#. module: bf_property_privacy
#: model_terms:privacy.purpose,plain_language_summary:bf_property_privacy.purpose_property_register
msgid ""
"Le registre se consulte selon l'article 1070.1, aux\n"
"                conditions qu'il prévoit."
msgstr ""
"The register may be consulted under article 1070.1, on the\n"
"                conditions it provides."

#. module: bf_property_privacy
#: model_terms:privacy.purpose,plain_language_summary:bf_property_privacy.purpose_property_register
msgid ""
"Le syndicat tient un registre où figurent le nom et l'adresse\n"
"                postale de chaque copropriétaire et de chaque autre occupant de\n"
"                l'immeuble, ainsi que les procès-verbaux de l'assemblée et du\n"
"                conseil d'administration. Cette tenue est une obligation du\n"
"                Code civil du Québec (art. 1070) : elle ne repose pas sur votre\n"
"                consentement et ne peut pas être refusée."
msgstr ""
"The syndicate keeps a register containing the name and mailing\n"
"                address of each co-owner and of each other occupant of the\n"
"                immovable, as well as the minutes of the general meeting and of\n"
"                the board of directors. Keeping it is an obligation under the\n"
"                Civil Code of Québec (art. 1070): it does not rest on your\n"
"                consent and cannot be refused."

#. module: bf_property_privacy
#: model:ir.model,name:bf_property_privacy.model_bf_property_organisation
msgid "Organisation responsable d'un immeuble"
msgstr "Organisation answering for an immovable"

#. module: bf_property_privacy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_privacy.view_property_sms_consent_form_privacy
msgid "Registre des activités de traitement (Loi 25)"
msgstr "Register of processing activities (Act 25)"

#. module: bf_property_privacy
#: model:privacy.purpose,name:bf_property_privacy.purpose_property_register
msgid "Registre du syndicat de copropriété"
msgstr "Register of the syndicate of co-ownership"

#. module: bf_property_privacy
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_privacy/models/bf_property_sms_consent.py:0
msgid "Retiré au registre du syndicat (art. 1070 al. 1 C.c.Q.), le %s."
msgstr ""
"Withdrawn from the syndicate's register (art. 1070 para. 1 CCQ), on %s."

#. module: bf_property_privacy
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_property_privacy.field_bf_property_sms_consent__privacy_consent_status
msgid "Statut au dossier Loi 25"
msgstr "Act 25 file status"

#. module: bf_property_privacy
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_property_privacy.field_bf_property_organisation__privacy_retention_warning
msgid "Écart de conservation"
msgstr "Retention gap"

#. module: bf_property_privacy
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_privacy.field_bf_property_organisation__privacy_retention_warning
msgid ""
"⚠️ Non stocké : il dépend d'un enregistrement d'un autre module, que rien "
"n'oblige à passer par ici quand il change."
msgstr ""
"⚠️ Not stored: it depends on a record of another module, which nothing "
"obliges to pass through here when it changes."
